    "notes": [
      "仓库已有资产原字节迁移；历史来源和派生记录见 config、NOTICE.md 及生成脚本。",
      "2026-10-08: flange/semantic-name URDF revision; original snapshots retained; EEF calibration and legacy MJCF/USD unchanged.",
      "2026-10-09: slave flange axes set to +Z tool axis/+Y left finger; standalone root moved to the body mating face; slave_cover_link removed (duplicate of base_link.STL geometry, 0.068231 kg imported mass dropped); massless slave_eef_link moved to the former cover frame origin with +Z toward the tips.",
      "2026-10-09: MJCF/USD regenerated from the current URDF (flange root, +Z tool axis, semantic names).",
      "2026-10-09: slave_body_link merged into taccap_base_link (gripper mounting face, body mesh and mass); optional adapter is the root taccap_mount_link; links/joints renamed with the taccap_ prefix. Finger link frames aligned to the base axes (hinge +X). Wrist camera/optical frames added: position from the CAD-marked camera point, orientation from the window axis (uncalibrated).",
      "2026-10-09: EEF unified to the fingertip face centre (mesh-derived, shared by master and slave).",
      "2026-10-10: Follow company public XTac-UMI-Description release c46c088579f15b1f08e8aba7c313495e4813b0b0; model and original-source hashes unchanged. Public notices, permission metadata and preview synchronized; private layout retained.",
      "Previous internal import source: xense-description@3ea62cc5a131e929a4a7ebc754fcf8fdf9c9a8a3 (local_working_tree); full prior asset record and notice retained in provenance/internal_import.json and provenance/internal_notice.md.",
      "Public upstream file hashes and directory mappings are recorded in assets/grippers/xense/taccap/upstream.json; see docs/TACCAP_UPSTREAM.md."
    ]
  },
